      <p style="font-size:1rem;color:#a1a1aa;margin:0 0 24px;line-height:1.75;max-width:700px">Sign any PDF in your browser in about thirty seconds. Draw your signature with a mouse, trackpad or finger, type your name in a handwriting-style font, or photograph a signature you have written on paper — the tool separates the ink from the paper automatically, so shadows and off-white backgrounds do not follow it onto the document. Place the signature anywhere on any page, resize it, add a date or printed name beside it, and download. No sign-up, no login, no watermark, and no limit on how many documents you sign.</p>
      <p id="seo-direct-answer" style="font-size:0.95rem;color:#e4e4e7;background:#18181b;border-left:3px solid #60a5fa;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:14px 18px;margin:0 0 28px;line-height:1.7;max-width:720px">To sign a PDF free, open it in a browser signing tool, create your signature, and place it on the page. On ihatepdf, upload the PDF and the signature pad opens straight away — draw with a mouse or finger, type your name in a handwriting font, or upload a photo of your handwritten signature and the paper background is removed automatically so only the ink is placed on the page. Position it, resize it, and download. No account, no login, no watermark, and the document is never uploaded to a server.</p>
